I made this project as a free digital love letter that anyone can use to make something special for their loved ones. I wanted it to be simple, cute, and personal, so I added things like a letter, pictures, memories, a bouquet, and little hidden surprises. I also used AI to help me when I ran into errors and problems while making it, especially when I didn't know how to fix certain parts. I still worked on and edited the project myself to make it the way I wanted. I’m sharing it here in case anyone else wants to make their own digital love letter too. ♡
